  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>这款华丽的资源包添加了大量全新的随机物品，例如“MrBeast 钻石”、作为下界合金剑的 RTX 4090，甚至将原铁做成鸡块。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">在更新发布到 Modrinth 之前，加入 Discord 获取抢先体验版本。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><em>（MrBeast 钻石的图片并非来自真实视频，请勿起诉我。）</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Modrinth 页面：<a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fdipdoops-totally-awesome-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">dipdoop 的超棒资源包</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">还可以查看</span><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fdipdoops-totally-awesome-raw-iron-(create-compat)\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">dipdoop 的超棒原铁（Create 兼容版）</span></a></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">Discord：<a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://discord.gg/8Wr3CNW2gA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">dipdoop 的超棒服务器</a></span></h2>",
